WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:04.692
Helena owns the Meridian workspace.

2
00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:08.470
Roles and permissions is where she decides who can do what.

3
00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:12.321
A role is a set of permissions, written in plain words.

4
00:00:12.321 --> 00:00:14.490
People can hold more than one role,

5
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.527
and their access is everything those roles allow.

6
00:00:17.939 --> 00:00:22.348
Meridian has hired a data clerk to type up paper forms from the field.

7
00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:25.876
None of the built-in roles fits, so she makes a new one.

8
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:30.533
She starts with no permissions, and adds only what the job needs.

9
00:00:30.974 --> 00:00:34.863
The clerk needs to see projects and forms, and to send data.

10
00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:35.705
Nothing more.

11
00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:39.370
Approving data and editing indicators stay unticked.

12
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.879
A clerk can enter figures, but someone else checks them.

13
00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:46.365
Now she invites the new clerk, Esther, from People.

14
00:00:51.655 --> 00:00:55.630
She gives Esther the Data clerk role, and sends the invitation.

15
00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:57.976
Next, Joseph.

16
00:00:57.976 --> 00:01:02.362
He is an M&E officer, and he now also manages two projects.

17
00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.666
So he needs a second job title.

18
00:01:05.078 --> 00:01:07.005
She adds Programme manager.

19
00:01:07.005 --> 00:01:10.574
His M&E work stays his home, the page he lands on.

20
00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:15.557
One thing only the owner can do is make someone an organisation admin.

21
00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:20.956
Any other admin sees that option greyed out, and nobody can change their own roles.

22
00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:23.994
Here is what that looks like for Joseph.

23
00:01:23.994 --> 00:01:25.370
He signs in as usual.

24
00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:33.591
His home opens on his M&E work: the figures waiting for review,

25
00:01:33.591 --> 00:01:35.605
and the forms he looks after.

26
00:01:36.044 --> 00:01:37.789
His menu now has Work as.

27
00:01:37.789 --> 00:01:40.093
He switches to Programme manager.

28
00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:43.995
Now the home follows that job:

29
00:01:43.995 --> 00:01:47.505
this week's activities and deadlines for his projects.

30
00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:49.715
His access is the same either way.

31
00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:51.795
Only the starting point changes.

32
00:01:52.201 --> 00:01:56.459
His profile lists both roles, but he cannot change them himself.

33
00:01:56.459 --> 00:01:58.854
That stays with an admin, on People.

34
00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:03.961
Custom roles for new jobs, more than one role for people who wear two hats,

35
00:02:03.961 --> 00:02:07.138
and a clear limit on who can hand out admin rights.
